12
00:00:25,270 --> 00:00:28,610
Let's take roulette. An American wheel has thirty-eight pockets.

13
00:00:29,260 --> 00:00:31,475
Bet on one number and win, and they pay

14
00:00:31,475 --> 00:00:32,460
