17
00:00:37,300 --> 00:00:40,381
That little gap? That's the house edge. About five

18
00:00:40,381 --> 00:00:41,750
point two six percent.

19
00:00:42,400 --> 00:00:45,613
In plain English: for every one hundred dollars bet,

20
00:00:45,613 --> 00:00:48,826
